  "description": "Snapshot tests for PDFs with PdfPecker: compare a generated PDF with a stored one after leaving out dates, file IDs and compression, and get page images with the changed pixels marked when they differ. Also checks for text and page counts. Works with xUnit, NUnit, MSTest or any other test framework, because a failed check throws.",
